  "cues": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start": 0.27,
      "end": 6.55,
      "text": "Marijuana, also known as weed or pot, refers to the dried leaves, flowers, stems, and seeds",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.152065,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.009407
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": 6.55,
      "end": 11.35,
      "text": "from the hemp plant cannabis sativa, which contains the psychoactive and mind-altering",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.152065,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.009407
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": 11.35,
      "end": 17.87,
      "text": "chemical Delta 9 tetrahydrocannabinol, or THC, as well as other related compounds.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.152065,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.009407
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": 17.87,
      "end": 25.69,
      "text": "Let's take a fun look at some interesting facts about the world's most beloved plant.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.152065,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.009407
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": 25.69,
      "end": 31.47,
      "text": "Researchers find that 42% of people surveyed in the US have tried marijuana at least once.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.152065,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.009407
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": 31.47,
      "end": 36.47,
      "text": "In contrast, only 20% of people surveyed in the Netherlands, where weed has been legal",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.133564,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.014954
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": 36.47,
      "end": 40.17,
      "text": "for 38 years, reported having tried pot.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.133564,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.014954
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": 40.17,
      "end": 45.51,
      "text": "Out of the estimated 22 million pounds of marijuana grown each year in the United States, nearly",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.133564,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.014954
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": 45.51,
      "end": 50.47,
      "text": "80% comes from California, Tennessee, Kentucky, Hawaii, and Washington.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.133564,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.014954
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": 50.47,
      "end": 54.35,
      "text": "An estimated one-third of America's weed is grown indoors.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.133564,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.014954
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": 54.35,
      "end": 61.13,
      "text": "An indoor grow module accommodating four plants sucks as much electricity as 29 refrigerators",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.133564,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.014954
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": 61.13,
      "end": 62.57,
      "text": "in California.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.126934,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000883
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": 62.57,
      "end": 67.77,
      "text": "Indoor marijuana grow modules account for about 9% of household electricity use.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.126934,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000883
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": 67.77,
      "end": 73.09,
      "text": "In Colorado, where the recreational use of marijuana was recently legalized, only 9%",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.126934,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000883
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": 73.09,
      "end": 75.33,
      "text": "of residents are regular pot smokers.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.126934,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000883
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": 75.33,
      "end": 79.57,
      "text": "Denver has surpassed Amsterdam as the capital of the marijuana world.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.126934,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000883
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": 79.57,
      "end": 84.77,
      "text": "The city has more than 300 stores, called dispensaries, outnumbering pharmacies, liquor",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.126934,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000883
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": 84.77,
      "end": 87.65,
      "text": "stores, public schools, and even Starbucks.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.126934,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000883
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": 87.65,
      "end": 92.41,
      "text": "In Colorado, recreational pot has a hard time competing with medical marijuana, which has",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.126772,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.005219
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": 92.41,
      "end": 97.33,
      "text": "been legal since 2000 and whose tax rate is 78% lower.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.126772,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.005219
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": 97.33,
      "end": 103.41,
      "text": "Estimated pot sales are 55 tons of medical pot and 18.4 tons of recreational pot.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.126772,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.005219
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": 103.41,
      "end": 108.93,
      "text": "The use among teens has not increased the legalization of recreational weed.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.126772,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.005219
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": 108.93,
      "end": 114.45,
      "text": "Legalizing marijuana federally would generate $8.7 billion in federal and state tax revenue",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.126772,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.005219
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": 114.45,
      "end": 116.01,
      "text": "per year.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.126772,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.005219
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": 116.01,
      "end": 119.89,
      "text": "California was the first U.S. state that banned marijuana a century ago.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.119553,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.132935
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": 119.89,
      "end": 125.13,
      "text": "In the U.S., a sentence of life in prison without parole was given for trying to sell",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.119553,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.132935
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": 125.13,
      "end": 128.65,
      "text": "$10 of marijuana to an undercover officer.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.119553,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.132935
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": 128.65,
      "end": 134.65,
      "text": "Over 800,000 people are arrested for marijuana in the U.S. each year.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.119553,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.132935
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": 134.65,
      "end": 138.37,
      "text": "Support for marijuana legalization is rapidly outpacing opposition.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.119553,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.132935
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": 138.37,
      "end": 145.17,
      "text": "A slim majority, 52% of Americans, say the drug should be made legal compared with 45%",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.119553,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.132935
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": 145.17,
      "end": 146.73,
      "text": "who want it to be illegal.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.157732,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.164429
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": 146.73,
      "end": 152.61,
      "text": "Opinions have changed drastically since 1969, when Gallup first asked the question and found",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.157732,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.164429
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": 152.61,
      "end": 156.53,
      "text": "that just 12% favored legalizing marijuana use.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.157732,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.164429
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": 156.53,
      "end": 161.09,
      "text": "Smoking up could be a very different experience for men and women, according to a 2014 study",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.157732,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.164429
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start": 161.09,
      "end": 163.85,
      "text": "in the journal Drug and Alcohol Dependence.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.157732,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.164429
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start": 163.85,
      "end": 168.57,
      "text": "In research on rats, it was discovered that females were more sensitive to cannabis pain-killing",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.157732,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.164429
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start": 168.57,
      "end": 173.05,
      "text": "qualities, but they were also more likely to develop a tolerance for the drug, which",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.157732,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.164429
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start": 173.05,
      "end": 177.57,
      "text": "could contribute to negative side effects and dependence on marijuana.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.13533,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.090088
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start": 177.57,
      "end": 182.09,
      "text": "Study after study finds that marijuana is less harmful than alcohol and tobacco.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.13533,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.090088
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start": 182.09,
      "end": 187.05,
      "text": "The beer and alcohol industries are two of the biggest anti-marijuana advocates.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.13533,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.090088
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start": 187.05,
      "end": 190.85,
      "text": "Obviously, marijuana is a serious threat to alcohol sales.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.13533,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.090088
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start": 190.85,
      "end": 196.01,
      "text": "Due to its safer nature, marijuana is often suggested as an alternative to alcohol.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.13533,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.090088
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start": 196.01,
      "end": 198.97,
      "text": "However, heavy use can be harmful.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.13533,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.090088
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start": 198.97,
      "end": 203.41,
      "text": "Since pot smoke is chemically very similar to tobacco smoke, heavy pot smokers are at",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.140696,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.129395
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "start": 203.41,
      "end": 207.85,
      "text": "risk for some of the same health effects as cigarette smokers like bronchitis and other",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.140696,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.129395
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "start": 207.85,
      "end": 212.73,
      "text": "respiratory illnesses, though the risks are from smoking, which isn't the only way to",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.140696,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.129395
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "start": 212.73,
